  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Rekon&#x161;trukcia a zlep&#x161;enie vybavenia Z&#xe1;kladnej &#x161;koly Mar&#x161;al Tito v Padine 2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rennovation of the Mar&#x161;al Tito Elementary School in Padina (Serbia)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Nakup a vybavenie noveho kabinetu informatiky, nakup po&#x10d;ita&#x10d;ov , stoli&#x10d;iek a lavicou a komplexn&#xe1; revitaliz&#xe1;cia priestorov prezliekarn&#xed; a wc pre diev&#x10d;at&#xe1; a chlapcov.&#xa0;&#xda;&#x10d;elom projektov je zabezpe&#x10d;enie kvalitn&#xe9;ho vzdel&#xe1;vania, spr&#xed;stupnenie slu&#x17e;ieb infra&#x161;trukt&#xfa;ry z&#xe1;kladnej &#x161;koly. 1. Skvalitnenie z&#xe1;kladnej &#x161;koly 2. Vn&#xfa;torn&#xe9; vybavenie z&#xe1;kladnej &#x161;koly.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Purchase and equipment of a new computer science cabinet, purchase of computers, chairs and a bench, and comprehensive revitalization of changing rooms and toilets for girls and boys. The purpose of the projects is to ensure high-quality education, making elementary school infrastructure services available. 1. Improving the quality of the elementary school 2. Internal equipment of the elementary school.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
